				<r3d:description language="eng">IPM Images is a project of the University of Georgia’s Center for Invasive Species and Ecosystem Health and one of the four major  parts of BugwoodImages. The Focus is on Integrated Pest Management. It provides an easily accessible archive of high quality images for use in educational applications. In most cases, the images found in this system were taken by and loaned to us by photographers other than ourselves. Most are in the realm of public sector images. The photographs are in this system to be used</r3d:description>
